# CR 601.2b: X is announced once, before any other part of the cost is
# paid -- ChoosePayX, asked ahead of every shard and every unit of generic --
# and its value is folded straight into the generic amount, so the same
# ChoosePayGeneric loop every other mana-payment fixture already exercises
# is what actually spends it: X=3 owes three units of generic on top of
# the plain {R} pip.
queue payx 3
queue paygeneric W
queue paygeneric W
queue paygeneric W
paymanacost human X R
